# Pairs with ChainCoversCommitted. The full capture resolves a committed saga's
# still-pending buckets pre-saga (the #4485 defect), so a full backup whose
# decision snapshot holds the saga committed restores it pre-saga.
MODULE: ChainCoversCommittedFullSnapReadsPre
TARGET: ChainCoversCommitted
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the full snapshot holds a committed saga pre-saga
PERTURBS: FullSnap

--- FIND
    /\ chain' = << FullLink(pending, FALSE) >>
--- REPLACE
    \* MUTATION: the committed saga is captured pre-saga.
    /\ chain' = << [FullLink(pending, FALSE) EXCEPT !.emit = {}] >>
--- END
